\section{Professional Experience}

\jobentry
  {Geospatial Backend Developer}
  {Spatial Science Innovators}
  {2025--Present}
  {Tehran, Iran}

\begin{itemize}
  \item Design and develop scalable geospatial backend services and
        RESTful APIs for spatial data processing, analysis, and delivery.

  \item Architect microservice-based geospatial platforms using
        Python, FastAPI, and PostGIS, with a focus on maintainability,
        reliability, and high-performance spatial queries.

  \item Build GeoAI pipelines that integrate machine learning models
        with geospatial datasets to support predictive spatial analytics
        and intelligent decision-making.

  \item Develop Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers that enable AI
        agents to securely access and interact with geospatial tools,
        datasets, and analytical resources.

  \item Collaborate with cross-functional engineering and domain teams
        to deliver enterprise-grade spatial data infrastructure and
        production-ready geospatial solutions.
\end{itemize}

